export const prerender = false;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — GoCommerce BD</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy detailing how GoCommerce BD collects, uses, and safeguards merchant and customer data." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="/assets/css/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="/assets/css/marketing.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    .legal-page {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      color: #1e293b;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .legal-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .legal-card h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .legal-updated {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .legal-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .legal-card p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .legal-card ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      list-style-type: disc;
    }
    .legal-card li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .back-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #155dfc;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .back-btn:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="background:#f8fafc;min-height:100vh;">
  <header class="site-header" style="background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;">
    <div class="layout header-inner" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 24px;">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/logo.png" alt="GoCommerce BD" style="height:40px;max-width:240px;width:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain;" /></a>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-white" style="font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;">Home</a>
        <a href="/create-store" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;">Create Store</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-btn"><i class="ri-arrow-left-line"></i> Back to Home</a>
    <div class="legal-card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="legal-updated">Last Updated: October 2026 • Effective Immediately</div>

      <p>GoCommerce BD ("we", "our", or "us") values your trust and is dedicated to safeguarding the privacy and security of your personal data. This Privacy Policy outlines our practices for collecting, managing, and protecting data across our services.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect essential data to operate our e-commerce platform and enable smooth storefront operations:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Merchant Information:</strong> Store name, merchant contact name, phone number (+880), email address, and encrypted credentials.</li>
        <li><strong>Customer Order Details:</strong> Customer name, delivery address, phone number, and items purchased to fulfill shipments and calculate cash-on-delivery (COD).</li>
        <li><strong>Technical & Analytics Data:</strong> IP address, device type, browser headers, and conversion event signals (Meta CAPI, TikTok Events).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Protect Your Data</h2>
      <p>We implement enterprise-grade security standards: all third-party API credentials and sensitive keys are encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM. Multi-tenant database queries enforce strict PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS) and tenant isolation.</p>

      <h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>We do NOT sell, rent, or trade personal data to third parties. Data is shared exclusively with designated service providers necessary for fulfilling store services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Connected shipping couriers (e.g., Steadfast, Pathao, RedX) for parcel delivery.</li>
        <li>Integrated payment gateways (e.g., bKash, Nagad, SSLCommerz) for payment verification.</li>
        <li>Cloud storage providers (Cloudflare R2) for media delivery.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Data Retention and Merchant Control</h2>
      <p>Merchants retain the right to access, export, or delete their store data and customer records at any time directly through the merchant dashboard or by contacting customer support.</p>

      <h2>5. Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect operational, legal, or regulatory changes. Any modifications will be posted here with an updated revision date.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this policy, please reach out to us at <strong>support@gocommerce.bd</strong> or by calling <strong>+880 1969 909069</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
